# The values this website is built with. Read at build time: Vite substitutes
# them into the bundle, so changing one means a rebuild, not a restart.

# Where the website reads the API — the base including its /api suffix.
# Public reads (GET /api/public/laboratories) answer any origin, so no
# CORS_ORIGINS entry is needed for this site.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.iigl.org/api
